OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Ball recalls starting his
OL,4,Acareer busking
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger and broadcaster Michael Ball has
OL,7,Fdescribed how his first public
OL,8,Fperformances were busking as a student.
OL,10,FThe West End star and radio presenter
OL,11,Fsaid he used to sing in an underpass in
OL,12,FGuildford, Surrey, while at drama
OL,13,Fschool.
OL,15,FBall said that, despite learning
OL,16,Facting, "I guess I had a voice".
OL,18,FSpeaking to BBC South East, ahead of a
OL,19,Fperformance in Brighton on his current
OL,20,Ftour, he said: "I never had any music
OL,21,Ftraining."
